# `unknown-name`: an associated type of another module's trait is reached as any of its
# names is, by `use` or qualification (Jimmy's ruling AK): `Item` alone names nothing here,
# `Boxes.Item` would. Written by Claude on the claude-bugs branch; subject to change.
mod Boxes

Opened: fn a -> Item a where a: ^Boxes.Box
fn Opened x = Boxes.Open x
